      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an incredibly heavy emotional weight from your long shifts. Witnessing human suffering on such a continuous basis can be absolutely exhausting and deeply demoralizing. Please remember that the profound care you provide, even when it feels futile, makes a genuine difference in someone's life right now. Don't hesitate to reach out to a colleague, supervisor, or a support service to help you manage this burnout.",
      "source": "target",
